    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1754377358\" data-has-big width=800 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenGrass is a 10\u201330 minute VR experience where you walk through a moody, stylized forest across three distinct days. Designed for performance and built in Unreal Engine, it combines the warm simplicity of sixth-gen console visuals with the presence only VR can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive under cover of night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the second day, the forest opens into something brighter, more atmospheric\u2014almost dreamlike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By evening, you retreat to a tent and settle in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no HUD, no objective markers, no distractions. Just you and the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Play in VR or 2D</strong> \u2013 Supports Meta PC VR and SteamVR headsets, as well as traditional flat-screen mode with gamepad or mouse/keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Three Narrative Days</strong> \u2013 Each part of the forest has a different feel, time, and emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Narrated Experience</strong> \u2013 A voice guides you through the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Designed like a sixth-gen game brought into VR: textured, colorful, and evocative\u2014not low-poly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Minimal HUD</strong> \u2013 Just the essentials: subtle prompts for grabbable items, nothing more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f <strong>Compact Length</strong> \u2013 Experience the full story in just 10\u201330 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb7 <strong>Priced Like a Coffee</strong> \u2013 \u00a34 for a tightly focused, atmospheric escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc63 <strong>No Combat, Just Presence</strong> \u2013 Explore at your pace. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1754377358\" data-has-big width=800 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenGrass is a 10\u201330 minute VR experience where you walk through a moody, stylized forest across three distinct days. Designed for performance and built in Unreal Engine, it combines the warm simplicity of sixth-gen console visuals with the presence only VR can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive under cover of night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the second day, the forest opens into something brighter, more atmospheric\u2014almost dreamlike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By evening, you retreat to a tent and settle in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no HUD, no objective markers, no distractions. Just you and the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Play in VR or 2D</strong> \u2013 Supports Meta PC VR and SteamVR headsets, as well as traditional flat-screen mode with gamepad or mouse/keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Three Narrative Days</strong> \u2013 Each part of the forest has a different feel, time, and emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Narrated Experience</strong> \u2013 A voice guides you through the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Designed like a sixth-gen game brought into VR: textured, colorful, and evocative\u2014not low-poly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Minimal HUD</strong> \u2013 Just the essentials: subtle prompts for grabbable items, nothing more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f <strong>Compact Length</strong> \u2013 Experience the full story in just 10\u201330 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb7 <strong>Priced Like a Coffee</strong> \u2013 \u00a34 for a tightly focused, atmospheric escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc63 <strong>No Combat, Just Presence</strong> \u2013 Explore at your pace. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A short, immersive VR experience inspired by sixth-generation console aesthetics. Explore a stylized forest over three surreal days. Walk, watch, and rest. Built for performance and atmosphere, GreenGrass is a compact journey with a long echo.",
